quote.p:
$12 million for coarse cotton fabrics and perhaps other commodities to be
                        obtained from Japan through the barter of ECA cotton diverted to Japan from
                        the China Program;

$12.5 million for continuing support to the food rationing programs in Canton
                        and Swatow and for the initiation of new rationing programs in the principal
                        cities of Hainan Island;
